# Who to notify when coordinator-reply.sh answers a mailbox message.
# Format: <name as used in ask-coordinator.sh --from><TAB><cmux workspace:N[/surface:M]>
# Matching: exact name (case-insensitive), else the longest entry that is a
# prefix of the sender's name followed by a space or "(",
# e.g. "billing-fix" matches "billing-fix (a1b2c3d4)".
# Sessions cmux can't reach (e.g. desktop apps): leave them out and reply with
# SendMessage as well. Update this file when a session moves or closes.
# Optional: your name in notices ("[<name>] reply waiting for ...").
@coordinator	coordinator
# Examples (TAB-separated):
# billing-fix (Codex)	workspace:12/surface:40
# docs-refresh	workspace:15
